{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 717, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf8e7f25ef374f0b2f1b2f1c781432f2ff3f0f1d8f9aef369f36df8b2f473f0eff0a5f29ef0a9f7d12f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aa8143f273f274f0b88148", "baseline_text": "쌍무를 움직이려면，//엄청난 영력이 필요하겠군…//아이리스，괜찮니？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武を動かすには、//すさまじい霊力が必要だな……//アイリス、大丈夫か？", "pointer_offset": 604, "unit": "dialogue:5a03249ab3709efb", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 788, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0a2f7d1f3a88143f273f274f0af81442f2ff14ef97bf45bf471f2b8f0a8f0f481432f2ff271f0f9f8e7f279f14bf147f0b8f261f7d1", "baseline_text": "으…응，괜찮아．//조금 괴롭더라도，//모두를 위해서니까…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "う……うん、だいじょうぶ。//ちょっとくらいツラくても、//みんなのためだもん……", "pointer_offset": 608, "unit": "dialogue:e901afdaaad7992c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 867, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf7d12f2ff0b5f3eef1a9faaff35ff3d2f15a8144", "baseline_text": "아이리스…//오빠한테 배웠어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アイリス……//お兄ちゃんに教えてもらったの。", "pointer_offset": 612, "unit": "dialogue:432b1cfd51da62a5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 912, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f271f0f9f8e7f279f14bf147f0a8f1c7f7d12f2ff15afb6ff1ccf0b2f0a8f0f42f2ff14bfc95f94af154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "모두를 위해서라면…//어떤 일이라도//해낼 수 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "みんなのためなら……//どんなことだって//がんばれるって。", "pointer_offset": 616, "unit": "dialogue:3fadd1df8ecc8acb", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 969, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0c7f0b8f261f7d1f0aff0b2f0aef8aaf484fc95f1c8f14881b82f2ff271f0f9f8e7f279f14bf147f7d12f2ff0b5f3eef8e7f279f14bf14781b8", "baseline_text": "그러니까…아이리스 힘낼 거야∈//모두를 위해서…//오빠를 위해서∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だから……アイリスがんばる！//みんなのため……//お兄ちゃんのために∈", "pointer_offset": 620, "unit": "dialogue:c60457ffc977f398", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1038, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf7d1", "baseline_text": "아이리스…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アイリス……", "pointer_offset": 624, "unit": "dialogue:ec1a397859673d7d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1051, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0b1f8f4f271f0f9f8e7f279f14bf947f36bf36cf8b6f257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "나도 모두를 위해서 열심히 할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺もみんなのためにがんばるよ。", "pointer_offset": 628, "unit": "dialogue:12d5b9e6686eb2f6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 2125, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0b1f1d4f8c8f279f9a9f1c8f9c7f1cff29ef15a8144", "baseline_text": "나만을 위한 거면 좋겠어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺だけのためがいいな。", "pointer_offset": 632, "unit": "dialogue:fab328c2f2394b32", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1105, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0b1f8f4f271f0f9f8e7f279f14bf947f36bf36cf8b6f257f0f181442f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf7d12f2ff2c8f960f9d7f285f1438148", "baseline_text": "나도 모두를 위해서 열심히 할게．//아이리스…//함께 와 줄래？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺もみんなのためにがんばるよ。//アイリス……//一緒に来てくれるかい？", "pointer_offset": 636, "unit": "dialogue:985aa59d033631c1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1174, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f3a88143f1b1f1e7f0b2f0a481b82f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf957f263f0b2f1488143f2b6f0dff0a8f0f42f2ff0b5f3eefa82f2c8f960f154f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "응，물론이지∈//아이리스는 말이야，언제라도//오빠랑 함께 있어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん、もちろんだよ！//アイリスはね、いつでも//お兄ちゃんといっしょだよ∈", "pointer_offset": 640, "unit": "dialogue:cd82e5da403097c1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1247, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f9d4f263f0b2f148f7d12f2ff271f0f9f9daf484f99cfa85f1c8f14881b8", "baseline_text": "하지만 말이야…//모두들 힘내 줄 거야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でもね……//みんなもがんばってくれるよ！", "pointer_offset": 644, "unit": "dialogue:7e2d8506379e65a2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1288, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0d8f1d9f1d4f7d12f2ff271f8f9f0b5f3eef0e72f2ff18efa63f1cff0aff0a5f0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "그치만…//모두 오빠를//정말 좋아하니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だって……//みんなもお兄ちゃんのこと、//大好きだもん∈", "pointer_offset": 648, "unit": "dialogue:d7a1003cefcddfaf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1343, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f184f0adf1c98143f0aff0b2f0aef0aa81442f2ff8cff2c8f960f484f19cf14781432f2ff0dff0f4f8e7f0a4f167f0fa8144", "baseline_text": "고마워，아이리스．//다 함께 힘내서，//제도를 지키자．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ありがとう、アイリス。//みんなでがんばって、//帝都を守ろうな。", "pointer_offset": 652, "unit": "dialogue:bfd3e48ab1eb55ef", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1406, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "알았어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "りょーかい！", "pointer_offset": 656, "unit": "dialogue:511c9d4e5b8b511e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1419, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0b1f1d4f8c8f279f14bf14781432f2ff158f36df94bf3ebf0a2f9c7f1cff29ef15a8144", "baseline_text": "나만을 위해서，//노력해 줬으면 좋겠어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺だけのために、//がんばってほしいな。", "pointer_offset": 660, "unit": "dialogue:2337dc9cfe4b4a7f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1458, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0a2f2c3f7d12f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aa8143f0b5f3eef8e7f279f14bf1472f2ff36bf36cf8b6f0a5f984f154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "으음…//아이리스，오빠를 위해서//열심히 하고 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "う～ん……//アイリス、お兄ちゃんのために//がんばってるよ。", "pointer_offset": 664, "unit": "dialogue:b5779e7c5b4b4ecb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1517, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b5f3eef8e7f279f14bf147f0a8f1c781432f2ff25cf2c0f8a4fa57f94af154f957f2e181b8", "baseline_text": "오빠를 위해서라면，//뭐든지 할 수 있는 걸∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お兄ちゃんのためなら、//なんだってできるもん∈", "pointer_offset": 668, "unit": "dialogue:5d53b41e19de1b96", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1564, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f9d4f263f0b2f148f7d12f2ff271f0f9f8e1f1ccf0f481432f2ff393f0a2f9c7f991f2678144", "baseline_text": "하지만 말이야…//모두의 일도，//잊으면 안 돼．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でもね……//みんなのことも、//わすれちゃダメだよ。", "pointer_offset": 672, "unit": "dialogue:49a39942d72473e6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1615, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f271f0f9f944f154f0a2f0b8f26181432f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf9d7f0b5f3eef1442f2ff1bcf0b2f947f2c8f960f154f8c8f94af154f957f1c8f0a8f1688144", "baseline_text": "모두가 있으니까，//아이리스와 오빠가//둘이서 함께 있을 수 있는 거라구．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "みんながいるから、//アイリスとお兄ちゃんが//ふたりでいられるんだからね。", "pointer_offset": 676, "unit": "dialogue:024fc8dbc17715f5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1688, "capacity": 72, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf944f263f9a9f0e2f0a3f0f0f7d12f2ff1cff0af8143f271f0f9f8e7f279f14bf147f0a8f0f4f7d12f2ff8b2f1bdf25e8143f0c9f186f8bcf0b2f14ff0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "아이리스가 말한 대로네…//좋아，모두를 위해서라도…//이 싸움，반드시 이기자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アイリスの言うとおりだな……//よし、みんなのためにも……//この戦い、必ず勝とうな！", "pointer_offset": 680, "unit": "dialogue:91e10b59180c1f5d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1771, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f3a8f7d12f2ff2c9f2e9f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "응…//알았어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん……//りょーかいだよ！", "pointer_offset": 684, "unit": "dialogue:e79d50308c6512e2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1798, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b5f3ee8143fb89f0d8f14381482f2ff36cf0f7f9a9f1aaf18ef8c8f190f984f154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "오빠，왜 그래？//심각한 표정을 짓고 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お兄ちゃん、どうしたの？//むずかしいお顔してるよ？", "pointer_offset": 688, "unit": "dialogue:ab5d6c84101f46a9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 2150, "capacity": 72, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b88143f1acf195f8c8f0f2f157f0cff984f0a5f0b8f7d12f2ffa5bf94bf2e6f0a8f984f0a5f957f0f12f2ff144f8e4f1cff0c8f8a4f0c6f0f7f0a5f984f154f1f3f15a8144", "baseline_text": "아니，보답을 받는다고 하니…//뭘 해 달라고 하는 게//가장 좋을지 생각하고 있었어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや、恩返しとなると……//何をしてもらうのが//一番いいか、考えていたんだ。", "pointer_offset": 692, "unit": "dialogue:7a1dabde443ff5c5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1924, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f253f299f8f4f1cff184f7d12f2ff0aff0b88143f0b2f28af1448148f29ff2a081432f2ff0d8f299f8f4f1a3f14ff0a5f94ff0aff261f18cf18df7d1", "baseline_text": "저것도 좋고…//아니，이건가？잠깐，//그것도 포기하기 아까운데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あれもいいし……//いや、これか？　まてまて、//それも捨てがたいぞ……", "pointer_offset": 696, "unit": "dialogue:27a9b6f76b21badb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 1993, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0aff7d18148", "baseline_text": "하아…？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はぁ……？", "pointer_offset": 700, "unit": "dialogue:09831e3d0153e6be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 2004, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0a2f2c3f7d12f2ff0f4f253f8b6fa81f18ef0a5f29ef0a2f0b881432f2ff0dff162f25ff0e4f8b9f0d0f0aff144f947f2abf18ef257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "으음…//도저히 못 정하겠으니，//제국극장에 돌아가서 결정할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "う～ん……//ちょっと決めきれないんで、//帝劇に帰ってから決めるよ。", "pointer_offset": 704, "unit": "dialogue:3598b71ac3bd8f62", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 2071, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0b2f8dff25df15a81442f2ff0b5f3eef1442f2ff0adf2c3f0e2f8a3f14bf7d1", "baseline_text": "이제 됐어．//오빠가//마음대로 해…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もう、いいよ。//お兄ちゃんの//すきにすればぁ……", "pointer_offset": 708, "unit": "dialogue:53e48a25b8168d00", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04010.SBN", "offset": 2120, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 712, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
